      "note": "Fix committed to trunk (c4a85c6) AND cherry-picked to branch-2.x. The doubling ONLY manifests on branch-2.7: there register()->addDatanode() does stats.add(d) with the STALE nonDfsUsed BEFORE updateHeartbeatState(EMPTY) clears it. Trunk/2.8/2.9 already reset before add, masking the bug (verified: trunk pre-fix reproduction shows correct 10000, no doubling). So the faithful pre-fix tree is branch-2.7: fix=f90b9d2 (also patches HeartbeatManager.register ordering), pre_fix=b516235. private/fix.diff is the 2.7 fix; fix.trunk.diff kept for reference."
